5:["$","$L3",null,{"src":"/homepage/about/story-band-01.jpg","alt":"Where the name comes from","fill":true,"sizes":"(min-width: 1440px) 1600px, 100vw","priority":false,"quality":90,"className":"object-cover object-center"}]
6:["$","div",null,{"className":"ed-text md:order-2","children":[null,["$","h2",null,{"className":"ed-title text-h2 mt-3","children":"Where the name comes from"}],["$","div",null,{"className":"ed-body ed-body--lead mt-5 space-y-4","children":[["$","p","0",{"className":"text-body text-ink-body","children":"Raj is rule and raani is the woman who holds it. Together they are less a claim about royalty than about who a cloth like this was made to be worn by."}],["$","p","1",{"className":"text-body text-ink-body","children":"The word was chosen over a weaving term on purpose. Naming a shop after a technique fixes it to one technique, and the looms we buy from move between nine of them in a year. A saree is not defined by the method that produced it any more than a book is defined by its typeface, and the name should not pretend otherwise."}],["$","p","2",{"className":"text-body text-ink-body","children":"It is also a word almost anyone in north India can say and spell on the first attempt, which matters more than it sounds. A brand nobody can repeat out loud is a brand that travels only by link, and cloth like this has always travelled by recommendation."}]]}],null]}]
7:["$","$L2","story-band-philosophy",{"children":["$","section",null,{"className":"wrap section-pad  ","children":["$","div",null,{"className":"grid items-center gap-10 md:grid-cols-2 md:gap-16","children":[["$","div",null,{"className":"ed-media md:order-2","children":["$","$L4",null,{"href":"/pages/handloom","className":"group block overflow-hidden","aria-label":"What we commission, and what we turn down","children":[["$","div",null,{"className":"relative md:hidden w-full aspect-square transition-transform duration-300 ease-[ease-in-out] group-hover:scale-110","style":{"backgroundColor":"#B08D3F"},"children":["$","$L3",null,{"src":"/homepage/about/story-band-02.jpg","alt":"What we commission, and what we turn down","fill":true,"sizes":"100vw","priority":false,"quality":90,"className":"object-cover object-center"}]}],["$","div",null,{"className":"relative hidden md:block w-full aspect-square transition-transform duration-300 ease-[ease-in-out] group-hover:scale-110","style":{"backgroundColor":"#B08D3F"},"children":["$","$L3",null,{"src":"/homepage/about/story-band-02.jpg","alt":"What we commission, and what we turn down","fill":true,"sizes":"(min-width: 1440px) 1600px, 100vw","priority":false,"quality":90,"className":"object-cover object-center"}]}]]}]}],["$","div",null,{"className":"ed-text md:order-1","children":[null,["$","h2",null,{"className":"ed-title text-h2 mt-3","children":"What we commission, and what we turn down"}],["$","div",null,{"className":"ed-body ed-body--lead mt-5 space-y-4","children":[["$","p","0",{"className":"text-body text-ink-body","children":"We buy direct, from around forty looms within an hour of the shop, at a price agreed before the warp is set rather than argued after the piece comes off it."}],["$","p","1",{"className":"text-body text-ink-body","children":"The turning down is the harder half. We do not take powerloom at any price, and we do not stock it beside handloom under a softer word. We also refuse work that is technically fine and has nothing to say — a competent copy of a piece somebody else designed forty years ago is the easiest thing in this city to commission and the least worth owning. A commissioned saree is paid for in stages while it is still being woven, because a weaver carrying six months of work cannot also carry six months of our cash flow."}]]}],null]}]]}]}]}]
8:["$","$L2","story-band-journey",{"children":["$","section",null,{"className":"wrap section-pad  ","children":["$","div",null,{"className":"grid items-center gap-10 md:grid-cols-2 md:gap-16","children":[["$","div",null,{"className":"ed-media md:order-1","children":["$","$L4",null,{"href":"/pages/handloom","className":"group block overflow-hidden","aria-label":"How it started","children":[["$","div",null,{"className":"relative md:hidden w-full aspect-square transition-transform duration-300 ease-[ease-in-out] group-hover:scale-110","style":{"backgroundColor":"#2A3A6B"},"children":["$","$L3",null,{"src":"/homepage/about/story-band-03.jpg","alt":"How it started","fill":true,"sizes":"100vw","priority":false,"quality":90,"className":"object-cover object-center"}]}],["$","div",null,{"className":"relative hidden md:block w-full aspect-square transition-transform duration-300 ease-[ease-in-out] group-hover:scale-110","style":{"backgroundColor":"#2A3A6B"},"children":["$","$L3",null,{"src":"/homepage/about/story-band-03.jpg","alt":"How it started","fill":true,"sizes":"(min-width: 1440px) 1600px, 100vw","priority":false,"quality":90,"className":"object-cover object-center"}]}]]}]}],["$","div",null,{"className":"ed-text md:order-2","children":[null,["$","h2",null,{"className":"ed-title text-h2 mt-3","children":"How it started"}],["$","div",null,{"className":"ed-body ed-body--lead mt-5 space-y-4","children":[["$","p","0",{"className":"text-body text-ink-body","children":"With a bad purchase. A saree bought as handloom, worn twice, and then identified by the weaver asked to repair it as a powerloom piece sold at four times what it was worth. He was not surprised, which was the part that stayed with us. What that exposed is not a weaving problem — the weaving in this city is as good as it has ever been. It is a selling problem."}],["$","p","1",{"className":"text-body text-ink-body","children":"By the time a piece reaches a shopfront it has passed through enough hands that nobody left in the chain can tell you who made it, on what, or how long it took. A claim nobody can check is worth nothing, and the people who lose most by that are the weavers, who are paid as though the work were ordinary."}],["$","p","2",{"className":"text-body text-ink-body","children":"So the shop was built backwards from the loom rather than forwards from the rail, which is why there is one room and no wholesale, and why we can answer the question about weeks."}]]}],null]}]]}]}]}]
